    "description": "Nextbots follow you. Run and fight trending memes in Backrooms. \r\nOnline (multiplayer) FPS shooter with three modes: \"You nextbot\" , \"DeathMatch\", \"chase match\" and \"Survival nextbot\".\r\nGarrymodbattle is a fast-paced modern FPS shooter against nextbots.\r\nDo you like online shooters and multiplayer gun games? This is the best trending 3D real-time first-person shooter. Scary games chasing on the best maps! \r\nPlay with your friends, you will enjoy PvP shooting on your mobile device! \r\nPlay in the mode - Team Deathmatch : Team Fight against team (Counter-terrorist team AGAINST memes team)\r\n- kill or be killed. Kill other players and run away from the nextbots in  backroom.\r\nIf you've always wanted to play a  FPS multiplayer shooter garrys, now your dreams have come true! Scary games in the Horror genre where you play hide and seek granny, or chasing boss Granny. \r\nYou will appreciate the horror \"hide and seek\" in the backrooms! \r\nTry to hide in the back room as long as possible in the match before next boat chases and finds you. New \"horror game\" nextbots online! \r\n\"Nextbots in backrooms\" contains various types of realistic weapons and gun.  \r\nThe world of back rooms is a real arms war.  melon playground\r\nOpen new maps, but be careful, because at every step there could be someone waiting for you:\r\nAlternative\r\nAmogus\r\n\"Armstrong\", \r\nAvatar\r\nBanban\r\nBoys\r\nGigachad\r\nHasbik\r\n\"granny\" ,\r\nGru\r\nIsaac\r\n\"Rosalia Bizcochito\", \r\njerma\r\nNerd\r\n\"melon playground\" ,\r\n\"people playground\" ,\r\nNico's\r\nShukri\r\nWenomachainsama\r\n\"Obunga\" ,\r\nGorebox\r\nQuandale\r\nSaul\r\nThe Rock Dwayne Johnson\r\n\"Selene Delgado\",\r\nShrek\r\nSkibidi Bop\r\n\"Skibidi toilet\" ,\r\nSidorovich\r\nSanic\r\nWednesday nextbot\r\nScary games and chase back room - what awaits you! Choose granny skin and win the multiplayer match!\r\nJust imagine being chased by granny, or melon playground, or Obunga. You can become a skibidi toilet yourself and chase People playground.\r\nIn the shooter, you be presented with a huge arsenal of weapons- gun for every taste!\r\nBECOME THE STAR PLAYER: Climb the local and regional leaderboards to prove you\u2019re the greatest gamer of them all! fps counter strike multiplayer shooter! Best gun games :)\r\n\"Nextbots shooter\" - chase and scary creatures in this free atmospheric horror game. Discover heart-thumping terror, chase and scary creatures in this free atmospheric horror game.  In the Square, you can have fun with other players from all over the world \r\nand easily obtain rewards by opening gift boxes and treasure chests. Play as legends of horror and see through their eyes in a variety of Realms and unpredictable Trials. Best scary and horror game!\r\nObunga ... playing hide and seek?",
